{"id":"u-4392a1b5-32bc-4580-a3b0-0b5cf449f639","src":"community","title":"Frontline - Push / Pull - Part One","author":"Trav G.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/I6J8P9-frontline-push-pull","desc":"Hypertrophy full gym program.\n\n4 day a week, utilising a push / pull split. \n\nTraining 10 to 12 hard working sets each week, with no more than 6 working sets in one workout per muscle group. \n\nFor progressive overload, look doing double progression, so completing the top range of the reps for each set before you start thinking about add weight. \n\nPUSH DAYS - are split up between different pushing muscles, A will get more attention to some muscles example for this routine you will see A has 2 x shoulders and 2 x quads. Push B will have 2 x chest and 2 x triceps. The volume and sets will be higher for the muscle only being trained once in the work out. \n\nPULL DAYS - Each session will have 2 x posterior exercises, 1 upper back and 1 lat. One session will have 2 biceps, the other will have 1 bicep and 1 rear delt. \n\nPlease do 3 x 8 reps on calf raises (straight leg) twice a week when ever you can fit in and please add some ab work too.\n\nThis program is for 6 weeks, I will release part 2 which will switch up some exercises. \n\nAt the end of the 6th week, you can run this again changing up some of the exercises, or you can jump onto Part Two.","level":["Intermediate","Advanced"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":1,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-14T13:08:10.148Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Push A","Pull A","Push A","Pull B"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Pendulum Squat","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps"},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps"},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps"},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":4}],"note":"10 - 12 reps"},{"n":"Seated Lateral Raise Machine","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"10 to 12 reps"},{"n":"Cable Cross Tricep Pushdown","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hip Thrust (Machine)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps\n1 - 2 RIR"},{"n":"Chest Supported T Bar Row Pronated","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps\n1 - 2 RIR"},{"n":"Pull-Up (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps\n1 - 2 RIR"},{"n":"45 Hamstring Hyper Extension","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"10 to 12\n1 - 2 RIR"},{"n":"Incline Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8,"x":4}],"note":"10 to 12\n1 - 2 RIR"},{"n":"Reverse Pec Deck","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Incline Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dip (Weighted)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Extension","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"One Arm Lateral Raise (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Cable)","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Close Grip Bench Press (Smith Machine)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Leg Curl","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Chest Supported Low Row","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown (Neutral Grip)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Preacher Curl Machine","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":2}]}]}],[{"ex":[{"n":"Pendulum Squat","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps"},{"n":"Shoulder Press (Machine)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps"},{"n":"Bulgarian Split Squat (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":6,"rpe":8,"x":3}],"note":"6 to 8 reps"},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":9,"x":4}],"note":"10 - 12 reps"},{"n":"Seated Lateral Raise Machine","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":3}],"note":"10 to 12 reps"},{"n":"Cable Cross Tricep Pushdown","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hip Thrust (Machine